      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have fixed my issue, about 12 hours prior I setup a custom config for yt-dlp in my appdata and I guess that it was interfering with the yt-dlp that vrc uses itself causing issues. (My custom config was telling yt-dlp where to find my ffmpeg, where to download completed files and to set audio to flac).",
